      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>REST API documentation corrected.</p>\n\n<p>The intention with the endpoint was to explicitly keep it outside the main REST endpoint as it is in essence a utility method that will at some point go away, and it doesn't logically belong within the REST URI syntax.</p>",
